description: Required regeneration workflows for Grafana schemas, toggles, DI, and workspaces
globs: "{kinds/**,pkg/server/**,pkg/services/featuremgmt/**,go.mod,go.work}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Generated code workflows

Run the generator associated with the source being changed:

- Wire service initialization or dependency injection: `make gen-go`
- Dashboard or panel CUE schemas under `kinds/`: `make gen-cue`
- Feature toggle definitions under `pkg/services/featuremgmt/`: `make gen-feature-toggles`
- Added or changed Go modules/workspace membership: `make update-workspace`

Do not hand-edit generated outputs when a source definition and generator exist. Include relevant generated changes with their source changes and verify that regeneration is clean.
